  "name": "pairwise_advantage_loss",
  "intuition": "This loss emphasizes the difference in advantage signals between preferred and less preferred options, encouraging the model to assign higher probabilities to better options. Using advantage signals aligns with the true preference signals and can improve learning efficiency.",
  "pseudocode": "loss = -mean(logsigmoid(advantage_w - advantage_l) * weight)",
